<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 13-week T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 13-week T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of 13-week treasury bills on Wednesday, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last auction of similar, 12-week T-bills on July 10 last year, the average yield was 8.453 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
